          %p
            In other words, we have an isomorphism of adjunctions, and so, the two dualities (measurable Gelfand and
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Loomis-Sikorski+duality"} Loomis-Sikorski
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gelfand+duality"} Gelfand-type
            and a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stone+duality"} Stone-type
            description of one and the same duality.
          %p
            More details in
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#fritz_lorenzin"} FL’25, Section 4
